records.raw_generation:
NUMBER n.
INPUT(n).
NUMBER count=0, divisorcount=0.
LOOP (NUMBER i=1 TILL i<=n, i++) { IF (i%3!=0) { count+=1. } }
LOOP (NUMBER i=1 TILL i*i<=n, i++) { IF (n%i==0) { divisorcount+=1. IF (i*i==n) { divisorcount-=1. } } }
DISPLAYNL(count+divisorcount+21).

